BT 1 0 0 1 0 74 Tm /F1 10 Tf 14 TL 1.714276 Tw (A college technical event on agentic automation and RPA currently collects participant interest through) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.228122 Tw (phone calls, WhatsApp messages and walk-in sign-ups, which leads to duplicate entries, no advance) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.391977 Tw (record of how many attendees to expect per track, and no way for the organizing team to arrange kits,) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.432966 Tw (seating and session material before the event date. Organizers frequently under- or over-provision) Tj T* 0 Tw .004099 Tw (resources because there is no single, structured record of who is attending, from which institution, and what) Tj T* 0 Tw (they expect from the event.) Tj T* ET
