BT 1 0 0 1 0 60 Tm .263039 Tw 14 TL /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Grouping the twelve fields into these four sections keeps the form visually manageable despite the number) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.949099 Tw (of inputs being captured, and mirrors the natural order in which a participant thinks through their own) Tj T* 0 Tw .86628 Tw (registration \227 first \223) Tj (who am I) Tj (\224) Tj (, then \223) Tj (where am I from) Tj (\224) Tj (, then \223) Tj (when and what track do I want) Tj (\224) Tj (, and finally) Tj T* 0 Tw .002072 Tw (\223) Tj (what do I expect, and do I agree to the terms) Tj (\224) Tj (. Each section header in the live form is rendered in a distinct) Tj T* 0 Tw (accent colour so that participants can visually track their progress as they scroll down the page.) Tj T* ET
