BT 1 0 0 1 0 102 Tm .081706 Tw 14 TL /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Field-level validation was configured for every mandatory field, marked with an asterisk in the Form Builder.) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.060259 Tw (The Email field enforces a valid email pattern before submission is allowed; the Phone field restricts entry to) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.013789 Tw (a valid mobile number and prepends the country code selector \(defaulted to +91 for this event\); the Number) Tj T* 0 Tw .427976 Tw (field used for Team Size rejects non-numeric and negative input; and the Date field constrains entry to the) Tj T* 0 Tw 5.394276 Tw (dd-MMM-yyyy format through a calendar picker rather than free text. The Checkbox field for) Tj T* 0 Tw .479685 Tw (Agree_To_Code_Of_Conduct is set as mandatory so that the Submit action is blocked until the participant) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.304373 Tw (explicitly accepts the Terms of Service & Privacy Policy, which keeps the registration record legally and) Tj T* 0 Tw (administratively complete before it reaches the organizing team.) Tj T* ET
